## 1378. Replace Employee ID With The Unique Identifier

### Solution

```sql
SELECT eu.unique_id,
       e.name
FROM Employees e
LEFT JOIN EmployeeUNI eu
       ON e.id = eu.id;
```

**Concepts:** LEFT JOIN

