## 1661. Average Time of Process per Machine

### Solution

```sql
SELECT machine_id,
       ROUND(AVG(processing_time), 3) AS processing_time
FROM (
    SELECT a.machine_id,
           a.process_id,
           ROUND(b.timestamp - a.timestamp, 3) AS processing_time
    FROM Activity a
    JOIN Activity b
      ON a.machine_id = b.machine_id
     AND a.process_id = b.process_id
    WHERE a.activity_type = 'start'
      AND b.activity_type = 'end'
) t
GROUP BY machine_id;
```

**Concepts:** Self Join, Aggregation, AVG

