## 577. Employee Bonus

### Solution

```sql
SELECT e.name,
       b.bonus
FROM Employee e
LEFT JOIN Bonus b
       ON e.empId = b.empId
WHERE b.bonus < 1000
   OR b.bonus IS NULL;
```

**Concepts:** LEFT JOIN, NULL Handling

