## 1280. Students and Examinations

### Solution

```sql
SELECT p.student_id,
       s.student_name,
       p.subject_name,
       p.number AS attended_exams
FROM (
    SELECT *
    FROM (
        SELECT student_id,
               subject_name,
               COUNT(*) AS number
        FROM Examinations
        GROUP BY student_id, subject_name

        UNION

        SELECT st.student_id,
               su.subject_name,
               0 AS count
        FROM Students st
        CROSS JOIN Subjects su
    ) t
    GROUP BY student_id, subject_name
) p
LEFT JOIN Students s
       ON s.student_id = p.student_id
ORDER BY p.student_id,
         p.subject_name;
```

**Concepts:** CROSS JOIN, UNION, GROUP BY

