## 570. Managers with at Least 5 Direct Reports

### Solution

```sql
SELECT name
FROM Employee
WHERE id IN (
    SELECT managerId
    FROM Employee
    GROUP BY managerId
    HAVING COUNT(managerId) >= 5
);
```

**Concepts:** Subquery, HAVING, GROUP BY

