## 1934. Confirmation Rate

### Solution

```sql
SELECT s.user_id,
       ROUND(
           COUNT(
               CASE
                   WHEN action = 'confirmed' THEN 1
               END
           ) / COUNT(*),
           2
       ) AS confirmation_rate
FROM Signups s
LEFT JOIN Confirmations c
       ON s.user_id = c.user_id
GROUP BY s.user_id;
```

**Concepts:** CASE WHEN, Aggregation, LEFT JOIN
